@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001/api
@authToken = Bearer eyJhbGciOi...

### Crear Curso en Catálogo (Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/courses
Authorization: {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Arquitectura Cloud y Microservicios",
  "categoryId": "CAT_UUID_HERE"
}

### Obtener todos los cursos
GET {{baseUrl}}/courses
Authorization: {{authToken}}

### Inscribir al Alumno en un Curso (Alumno autenticado)
POST {{baseUrl}}/courses/courseUser
Authorization: {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "courseId": "COURSE_UUID_HERE"
}

### Eliminar Inscripción a un Curso (Alumno propietario)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/courses/courseUser/INSCRIPCION_UUID_HERE
Authorization: {{authToken}}
